abstract: >
  An AI-powered admissions advisor for Purdue's Mitch Daniels School of Business
  graduate programs. Combines a Voiceflow user-facing chat agent with a parallel
  LangChain + LangSmith Python observability pipeline. Built on a 77-chunk
  knowledge base covering 13 graduate programs, 5 applicant personas, and
  24 career-goal routing paths. Final project for MGMT 59000-ETB
  (Spring 2026), instructed by Rohit Aggarwal.
